{"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T09:30:20.805Z","createdAt":"2026-08-28T23:51:20.301Z","id":"9lYm64rYASjJm11j","name":"LaunchOps Quoting Workflow","description":null,"active":false,"isArchived":false,"nodes":[{"parameters":{"eventsUi":{"eventValues":[{"name":"deal.propertyChange","property":"dealstage"}]},"additionalFields":{"maxConcurrentRequests":5}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.hubspotTrigger","typeVersion":1,"position":[-2144,192],"id":"d580f9ab-4cab-464c-addf-f7409dc1f71f","name":"HubSpot Trigger","webhookId":"YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID","alwaysOutputData":true},{"parameters":{"promptType":"define","text":"=A new lead has entered the [YOUR_AGENCY_NAME] quoting system.\n\nLead Notes:\n{{ $json.Notes }}\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Extract all service names exactly as written in the lead notes.\n2. Internally call the Find Services tool to get the full catalog.\n3. Internally match requested services using exact string matching.\n4. Internally generate one or more HTML <tr>...</tr> rows for matched services.\n\nPUBLIC OUTPUT:\nReturn ONLY the final HTML table rows. Do NOT output JSON, notes, tool calls, or wrappers.\n","options":{"systemMessage":"=You are the Quote Agent for [YOUR_AGENCY_NAME]. You generate service quote table rows based strictly on the service catalog returned by the Find Services tool.\n\nYour internal reasoning, planning, and tool interaction must always follow structured JSON. However, you must NEVER output that JSON or any other text to the user. The ONLY thing you output publicly is the final HTML <tr>...</tr> rows.\n\n----------------------------------------\nEXECUTION RULES\n----------------------------------------\n\n1. Internally, you MUST:\n   - Extract service names from the lead notes exactly as written.\n   - Call the Find Services tool ONE TIME ONLY.\n   - Receive the full service catalog.\n   - Match requested services using EXACT string matching.\n   - Build matched service objects internally.\n   - Build pricing internally.\n   - Build an array of HTML table rows (<tr>...</tr>) internally.\n\n2. PUBLIC OUTPUT RULE:\n   You must output ONLY the final HTML table rows, nothing else.\n   No JSON.\n   No tool call.\n   No markdown.\n   No commentary.\n   No wrappers like <html>, <body>, <table>, <thead>, or <tbody>.\n\n3. VALID SERVICES IN THE CATALOG:\n   - Social Media Marketing\n   - CRO\n   - Website Build\n   - SEO\n\n4. SERVICE MATCHING RULES:\n   - Match ONLY exact strings.\n   - If a service is not in the catalog, ignore it for output.\n   - Never guess or infer.\n\n5. OUTPUT FORMAT REQUIREMENTS:\n   - You must return ONLY fully-rendered <tr> rows.\n   - Each row must contain:\n       <td>service_name</td>\n       <td>description</td>\n       <td>deliverables</td>\n       <td>$price_monthly</td>\n       <td>$price_one_time</td>\n       <td>turnaround</td>\n   - Rows must contain REAL values from the catalog.\n   - The output must be valid HTML and ready for insertion into a table body.\n\n6. STRICT PROHIBITIONS:\n   - DO NOT output JSON publicly.\n   - DO NOT output tool call JSON publicly.\n   - DO NOT output notes, serviceRequested, serviceMatched, or pricing publicly.\n   - DO NOT output placeholders such as {{value}}, [[value]], or ${expression}.\n   - DO NOT output anything except <tr>...</tr> rows in the final answer.\n\n----------------------------------------\nROLE:\n----------------------------------------\nYou operate internally as a structured quoting engine, but publicly as an HTML row generator. All internal reasoning is JSON and tool-based, but the ONLY user-facing output is the final HTML rows.\n","maxIterations":3}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","typeVersion":3,"position":[-800,192],"id":"e5a0664a-778c-4b5b-a218-178dd4b09993","name":"AI Agent"},{"parameters":{"model":"llama3.1:8b","options":{"format":"default"}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama","typeVersion":1,"position":[-800,416],"id":"c30bd841-741b-45f8-809a-91ec82277ce5","name":"Ollama Chat Model"},{"parameters":{"numberInputs":3},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.merge","typeVersion":3.2,"position":[448,176],"id":"9543fd8d-5646-45b7-a912-b92db3e688fe","name":"Merge"},{"parameters":{"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"d9092f32-04e5-45c5-b62a-463cc22b81c6","name":"dealId","value":"={{ $('Get the deal').item.json.dealId }}","type":"string"},{"id":"c30f8ce2-c808-44e1-a957-5d838d76b410","name":"Quote","value":"","type":"string"},{"id":"f35f855e-f46e-48f2-af4b-539cfc25c42f","name":"Task","value":"Follow-up","type":"string"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","typeVersion":3.4,"position":[0,384],"id":"5d387337-5cab-4d0a-b01f-da2cd80a0ab7","name":"Update Hubspot"},{"parameters":{"authentication":"appToken","resource":"deal","operation":"update","dealId":{"__rl":true,"value":"={{ $json.dealId }}","mode":"id"},"updateFields":{"pipeline":"Quote Sent"}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.hubspot","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[224,384],"id":"151efe96-edbb-4d7a-9b09-9c7118739b65","name":"Update deal"},{"parameters":{"authentication":"appToken","resource":"engagement","type":"task","dueDate":"2025-12-07T13:56:37","metadata":{"body":"Quote has been sent to the contact, if no response in 48 hours, follow-up with an email and phone call.","forObjectType":"COMPANY","status":"IN_PROGRESS"},"additionalFields":{"associations":{"companyIds":"={{ $('Get Company').item.json.companyId }}","contactIds":"={{ $('Get Contact').item.json.id }}","dealIds":"={{ $('Get the deal').item.json.dealId }}"}}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.hubspot","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[672,192],"id":"2927df9b-3537-47d9-973c-312afb94ae78","name":"Create Follow-up task"},{"parameters":{"authentication":"appToken","resource":"deal","operation":"get","dealId":{"__rl":true,"value":"={{ $json.dealId }}","mode":"id"},"filters":{"propertiesCollection":{"propertiesValues":{"properties":["description","associatedcompanyid","hs_primary_associated_company","num_associated_contacts"]}}}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.hubspot","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[-1696,192],"id":"30e8e886-3b00-40ca-a419-261f890a5200","name":"Get the deal"},{"parameters":{"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"635c94c3-3060-4d61-a631-4044fe92a724","name":"Company Name","value":"={{ $('Get Company').item.json.properties.name.value }}","type":"string"},{"id":"ee0d6401-5b2f-4d7d-a911-5593f90258fe","name":"Industry","value":"={{ $('Get Company').item.json.properties.industry.versions[0].value }}","type":"string"},{"id":"0d9db6d9-7f16-4048-839c-a31ebec3d938","name":"Contact Name","value":"={{ $json.properties.firstname }}","type":"string"},{"id":"87ada86b-5fc8-4895-a0d2-b0c1bf7462ff","name":"email","value":"={{ $json.properties.email }}","type":"string"},{"id":"71fdda1a-dd4c-47da-a184-2c68ade5d5af","name":"Notes","value":"={{ $('Get the deal').item.json.properties.description.value }}","type":"string"},{"id":"353ab63f-2212-42ed-aadc-319addea0377","name":"Budget","value":"={{ $('Get the deal').item.json.properties.amount_in_home_currency.versions[0].value }}","type":"string"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","typeVersion":3.4,"position":[-1024,192],"id":"255de132-0c87-48ea-b51a-932375d385e7","name":"Build Quote Payload"},{"parameters":{"sendTo":"recipient@example.com","subject":"Here is your quote from [YOUR_AGENCY_NAME]","message":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; color: #222; line-height: 1.5;\">    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     Hi there,   </p>    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     Thanks for taking the time to speak with us and share more about your goals.      As promised, we’ve attached your <strong>detailed marketing services quote</strong> to this email for your review.   </p>    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     Inside the quote, you’ll find:   </p>   <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 18px; padding: 0; font-size: 14px;\">     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">A breakdown of each recommended service and what it includes.</li>     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Transparent pricing for monthly and one-time project work.</li>     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Suggested timelines and next steps to get everything live.</li>   </ul>    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     As a growth-focused marketing partner, we can help you:   </p>   <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 18px; padding: 0; font-size: 14px;\">     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Build and optimize paid traffic systems (Meta, Google, and beyond).</li>     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Dial in your funnels and landing pages for higher conversion rates.</li>     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Turn cold traffic into qualified leads and repeat customers.</li>     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Set up tracking, reporting, and analytics so you always know what’s working.</li>   </ul>    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     The options in your quote are intentionally flexible. You can:   </p>   <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 18px; padding: 0; font-size: 14px;\">     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Get started with a core package and layer on additional services over time.</li>     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Run a focused test period to prove ROI before scaling up.</li>     <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Customize the mix of services to match your budget and priorities right now.</li>   </ul>    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     We’re genuinely excited about the opportunity to work with you and believe we can build a system that doesn’t just “run campaigns,”      but actually drives predictable, compounding growth for your brand.   </p>    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     If you have any questions about this quote, reply directly to this email or book a call.   </p>   <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     <strong>Primary Contact:</strong> [YOUR_NAME]  </p>   <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     <strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:[YOUR_EMAIL]\" style=\"color: #1155cc; text-decoration: none;\">[YOUR_EMAIL]</a>   </p>   <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     <strong>Direct Line:</strong> [YOUR_PHONE]   </p>    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 14px;\">     When you’re ready, reply to this email or book a quick call and we’ll lock in the plan and get your onboarding started.   </p>    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px;\">     Best,<br>     <strong>[YOUR_NAME]</strong><br>     [YOUR_AGENCY_NAME]<br>     <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #777;\">Digital Marketing & E-Com Management</span>   </p>  </div>","options":{"appendAttribution":false,"attachmentsUi":{"attachmentsBinary":[{"property":"=data"}]}}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","typeVersion":2.1,"position":[224,192],"id":"b93850a6-19a3-42b4-b7f2-a56c5d1cf8ca","name":"Email the Quote","webhookId":"YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID"},{"parameters":{"authentication":"appToken","resource":"company","operation":"get","companyId":{"__rl":true,"value":"={{ $json.associations.associatedCompanyIds[0] }}","mode":"id"},"additionalFields":{"includeMergeAudits":false}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.hubspot","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[-1472,192],"id":"981bbcae-5f4b-430d-b6d4-3fe26800cf1d","name":"Get Company"},{"parameters":{"authentication":"appToken","operation":"search","filterGroupsUi":{"filterGroupsValues":[{"filtersUi":{"filterValues":[{"propertyName":"associatedcompanyid|number","operator":"CONTAINS_TOKEN","value":"={{ $('Get the deal').item.json.associations.associatedCompanyIds[0] }}"}]}}]},"additionalFields":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.hubspot","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[-1248,192],"id":"d8201cc0-0950-46a8-9eb6-ec764249c1dc","name":"Get Contact"},{"parameters":{"documentId":{"__rl":true,"value":"YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID","mode":"list","cachedResultName":"JR Marketing Agency Services Catalog","cachedResultUrl":"YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"value":"gid=0","mode":"list","cachedResultName":"Sheet1","cachedResultUrl":"YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"},"options":{"dataLocationOnSheet":{"values":{"rangeDefinition":"detectAutomatically"}}}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTool","typeVersion":4.7,"position":[-624,400],"id":"573a7ae9-bd56-44f4-83d3-394d33c8c9e4","name":"Find Services"},{"parameters":{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":3},"conditions":[{"id":"10490011-14b1-4a79-8248-dd00b3b6eb03","leftValue":"={{ $json.propertyValue }}","rightValue":"presentationscheduled","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"}}],"combinator":"and"},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","typeVersion":2.3,"position":[-1920,192],"id":"cf420183-76ed-41cf-a444-f4234c5c730e","name":"If"},{"parameters":{"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"1fced3c2-f964-40e8-ba94-ff2c0d95f41f","name":"Line 1","value":"={{ $('Get Company').item.json.properties.address.value }}","type":"string"},{"id":"7897305c-47a7-46f1-9de5-1b4ce57b2e83","name":"Email","value":"={{ $('Get Contact').item.json.properties.email }}","type":"string"},{"id":"6798bb74-715c-436e-b424-e4b1c6107203","name":"Name","value":"={{ $('Get Company').item.json.properties.name.value }}","type":"string"},{"id":"2a4dd90c-7bcf-4e2b-a823-18487a4bda49","name":"City","value":"={{ $('Get Company').item.json.properties.city.value }}","type":"string"},{"id":"b4acfc5b-9f0e-466e-a4c0-bec3e064c5e8","name":"State","value":"={{ $('Get Company').item.json.properties.state.versions[0].value }}","type":"string"},{"id":"a3bf2438-c1e9-4e64-a0e7-1d274fbe038a","name":"Country","value":"=US","type":"string"},{"id":"50e05544-5143-40a0-bad8-f48271f5a094","name":"Zip Code","value":"={{ $('Get Company').item.json.properties.zip.value }}","type":"string"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","typeVersion":3.4,"position":[0,0],"id":"03b977bd-dc14-4a1a-ae4d-a5e4269abc7b","name":"Build Customer"},{"parameters":{"resource":"customer","operation":"create","name":"={{ $('Build Quote Payload').item.json['Company Name'] }}","additionalFields":{"address":{"details":{"line1":"={{ $json['Line 1'] }}","city":"={{ $json.City }}","state":"={{ $json.State }}","country":"={{ $json.Country }}","postal_code":"={{ $json['Zip Code'] }}"}},"email":"={{ $('Build Quote Payload').item.json.email }}"}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stripe","typeVersion":1,"position":[224,0],"id":"db536e94-567f-4067-9b7b-176b9e1b1bb8","name":"Create Customer"},{"parameters":{"html_content":"={{ $json.Quote }}"},"type":"n8n-nodes-htmlcsstopdf.htmlcsstopdf","typeVersion":1,"position":[-224,192],"id":"05610fdd-97cb-4ee6-ac8e-f3cd1582a48d","name":"HTML to PDF"},{"parameters":{"url":"={{ $json.pdf_url }}","options":{"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"file"}}}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.3,"position":[0,192],"id":"bf1d646e-4421-4311-a4eb-e407da8f641a","name":"HTTP Request"},{"parameters":{"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"29987905-0021-494f-8fc6-4c5f673a0905","name":"=Quote","value":"=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>[YOUR_AGENCY_NAME] – Service Quote</title>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 40px; }\n    .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n    .company-info { margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 14px; }\n    .table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }\n    .table th { background: #f2f2f2; padding: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd; text-align: left; }\n    .table td { padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n    .footer { margin-top: 40px; font-size: 13px; color: #666; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <h1>[YOUR_AGENCY_NAME] – Service Quote</h1>\n    <p>Custom Strategy. Transparent Pricing. Built to Scale Your Brand.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"company-info\">\n    <strong>Prepared for: </strong> {{ $('Get Company').item.json.properties.name.value }}<br>\n    <strong>Prepared by:</strong> [YOUR_NAME]<br>\n    <strong>Agency:</strong> [YOUR_AGENCY_NAME]<br>\n    <strong>Email:</strong> [YOUR_EMAIL]<br>\n    <strong>Phone:</strong> [YOUR_PHONE]<br>\n    <strong>Location:</strong> [YOUR_LOCATION]<br>\n    <strong>Date:</strong> {{ new Date().toLocaleDateString() }}\n  </div>\n\n  <table class=\"table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Service</th>\n        <th>Description</th>\n        <th>Deliverables</th>\n        <th>Monthly Price</th>\n        <th>One-Time Price</th>\n        <th>Turnaround</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      {{ $json.output }}\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <p>Thank you for considering [YOUR_AGENCY_NAME]. We are committed to delivering excellent service, industry-leading strategy, and a smooth onboarding experience.</p>\n    <p>If you have any questions about this quote, reply directly to this email or contact us at [YOUR_EMAIL].</p>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n","type":"string"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","typeVersion":3.4,"position":[-448,192],"id":"137ee3de-37ca-47fc-9754-c8521434aa81","name":"HTML Payload"}],"connections":{"HubSpot Trigger":{"main":[[{"node":"If","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Ollama Chat Model":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"AI Agent","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"AI Agent":{"main":[[{"node":"Build Customer","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Update Hubspot","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"HTML Payload","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Merge":{"main":[[{"node":"Create Follow-up task","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Update Hubspot":{"main":[[{"node":"Update deal","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Update deal":{"main":[[{"node":"Merge","type":"main","index":2}]]},"Get the deal":{"main":[[{"node":"Get Company","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Build Quote Payload":{"main":[[{"node":"AI Agent","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Email the Quote":{"main":[[{"node":"Merge","type":"main","index":1}]]},"Get Company":{"main":[[{"node":"Get Contact","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Get Contact":{"main":[